  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Night falls over the city while a few people remain in discussion. Their talk includes <rs type="keyword" ref="#socialism">public life</rs>, labor, law, and the ordinary conditions of daily life.</p>
      <p>The examples are plain: road, window, ledger, coat, and lamp. These objects are not grand, but they hold attention because they are familiar and real, and <rs type="keyword" ref="#naturalism">nature</rs> is present in the background.</p>
      <p>By the end, the point is clear enough: clarity, testimony, and practical reason are more useful than ceremonial speech. <rs type="keyword" ref="#secular-humanism">Human purpose</rs> is named once more. <gap></gap></p>
    </body>
  </text>
